00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:50.230
I see.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.230
So the young master took in the stone.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:55.980
Sorry.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.280
If only we had been able to stop him...

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.360
You don't need to apologize.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.240
I am only mad at myself for not being able to fulfill my duty as a bodyguard.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.700
