00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:45.360
May?!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:50.990
What?!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.410
As expected of the Yao Clan's watchdog.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.580
And you're... the Chan Clan's successor.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.710
Indeed.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.380
I'm the 17th Princess of Xing, May Chan.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.920
