00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:08.760
I'll never let you and your clan have it!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.060
You won't even be able to find it!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.060
Hang on!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:17.770
